OL,3,AOne stolen every four minutes - inside
OL,4,Athe police battle against vehicle
OL,5,Athieves
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt is 01:00 on a Thursday and we are in
OL,8,Fthe back of an unmarked police car on
OL,9,Fthe hunt for vehicle thieves in east
OL,10,FLondon.
OL,12,FA call comes in over the radio about a
OL,13,Fstolen Ford Transit van. Within 25
OL,14,Fminutes officers have found it, chased
OL,15,Fit down and arrested a suspect.
OL,17,FOfficers tell us the night has been
OL,18,Fsuccessful, with further arrests made,
OL,19,Fyet across the UK a car is stolen every
OL,20,Ffour minutes.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
